The derived portions that remain in this repository are:

- apps/server/internal/admin (document store, secret redaction, sample rows)
- apps/server/internal/gateway (routing, guardrails, dialects, upstream calls)
- apps/server/internal/httpapi (client protocol adapters, SCIM, streaming outcome writer)

The admin console that shipped with Antirion is not included. WowRouter's web
UI is apps/panel. The Antirion OpenAPI document is not included.

The bundled models.dev catalog snapshot was not carried over, so that data is
not redistributed here.
